## 🖥️ iStat Menus for Mac — Complete System Visibility

iStat Menus is a powerful menu-bar system monitor designed for users who want detailed information about what their Mac is doing. It can display CPU and GPU activity, memory pressure, disk usage, network bandwidth, battery information, sensors, weather, clocks, and other system details from highly customizable menu-bar items.

### ✨ Why Users Choose iStat Menus

* 🧠 **CPU Monitoring** — View processor activity, core usage, load averages, frequency, uptime, and process information.
* 🎮 **GPU Monitoring** — Track GPU processor usage, memory, temperature, frequency, and supported performance data.
* 💾 **Memory Tracking** — Monitor memory usage, pressure, compressed memory, swap, and memory-heavy applications.
* 💽 **Disk Activity** — Check storage space, disk activity, S.M.A.R.T. information, and application disk usage.
* 🌐 **Network Monitoring** — See bandwidth activity, connection information, IP addresses, and network status.
* 🔋 **Battery & Power** — Track battery state and supported Bluetooth-device battery levels.
* 🌡️ **Sensors** — Inspect available temperatures, fans, frequencies, power, voltage, and current information.
* 🌦️ **Weather** — Access current conditions and detailed forecasts from the menu bar.
* 🕒 **Time & World Clocks** — Build customizable clocks, calendars, and world-time displays.
* 🎨 **Customization** — Adjust menu-bar layouts, colors, item order, displayed information, and more.

